%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: YuriGetsGrilled
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852045
    - rid: 8164893166592852048
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri yawns as she gets out of bed to start her day.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852046
    - rid: 8164893166592852047
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Ah, despite everything, I've managed to get a good night's rest.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852049
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah good, you're here and awake.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852050
    - rid: 8164893166592852052
    - rid: 8164893166592852051
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: U-um, is the Thalmor delegation already here?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852053
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: No, but we do expect them to arrive within the hour.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852054
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Come with me to my quarters; I've gathered everyone else who'll be attending
      to get our story straight.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852055
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Y-yes, of course.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852056
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852057
    - rid: 8164893166592852058
    - rid: 8164893166592852059
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Since we're all here, and we don't have time to waste, let's begin.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852060
    - rid: 8164893166592852062
    - rid: 8164893166592852065
    - rid: 8164893166592852070
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Full chronology of events?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852066
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: I suppose it all started with our expedition into Saarthal.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: This apprentice and her friend-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: U-um, my n-name is Yuri...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852067
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri and her friend managed to get themselves trapped and used an ancient
      amulet to break further into the ruin.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852068
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri unconsciously grabs onto the amulet she found in Saarthal, which
      she's been wearing ever since she first put it on.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893166592852069
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: We eventually came across what we now refer to as the Eye of Magnus,
      being guarded by an ancient draugr-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Who, initially, channeled part of its power into himself to become nigh
      invulnerable.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Obviously, such a discovery would attract the interest of any self-respecting
      academic...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, I organized its retrieval after sending the apprentices back to inform
      Archmage Aren.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: My plans to research the Eye further were interrupted by the appearance
      of a Psijic Monk, the day after the expedition.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Only the Archmage, Ancano, and the two apprentices were there for that
      conversation, so, Yuri...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351744
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: What happened, then?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351745
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: A-ah, well...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351746
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: To get the full story, you would have to ask Sayori.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351747
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: The Psijic Monk froze time to have a private conversation with her, I
      assume to avoid Ancano learning anything he shouldn't have.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351748
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Based on what she said afterward, I assume the Psijic Monk told Sayori
      about how potentially dangerous the Eye of Magnus was.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351749
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: With that, the two of us convinced Archmage Aren to help us find the
      Staff of Magnus, which we knew would be critical in keeping the Eye in check.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351750
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3b9d3d794309e1848a67c6a6897eddf2, type: 2}
    dialog: How did you know that you need the Staff of Magnus?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351751
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: A-ah... Umm...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: The, uh, Psijic M-monk told Sayori about it...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351752
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3b9d3d794309e1848a67c6a6897eddf2, type: 2}
    dialog: Did they now?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351753
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Y-yes!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351754
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: ... If you are going to lie in the presence of the Thalmor delegation,
      you should at the very least be more convincing.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351755
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Continue.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351756
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah-! Right, right...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351757
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Um, after that Aren, Sayori, and I all went to Labyrinthian, which is
      where the Staff of Magnus was.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351758
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: We fought our way through everything, reaching a central chamber where
      we found the Staff of Magnus-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351759
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Which was in the hands of ancient, powerful, and evil dragon priest known
      as Morokei.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351760
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: We would've been defeated, if not for Archmage Aren sacrificing himself
      so that Morokei's mightiest magic could be sealed away while Sayori and I dealt
      with him.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351761
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Whatever that means.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351762
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, so around 75 pounds of scale, then.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351763
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Better than nothing, I suppose.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351764
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Since they had more scales than necessary, Eorlund decided to test one
      at various temperatures in the forge.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351765
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: He was able to find a temperature at which the scales become malleable
      enough to be hammered, but not so hot they begin to burn or melt.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, so dragon scale is best struck after smelting at Fourth-Coal...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Fourth-Coal, Eolund?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351766
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: If you'd recall, apprentice, the forge's coal stage is a way of describing
      how hot it is.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: To reach Fourth-Coal, you need four measures of kindlings to be placed
      within the forge- properly aerated, of course.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351767
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh yeah, right.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351768
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Now, we'll definitely be weaving these scales like a tradition scalemail-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351769
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Which means we'll need some sort of metal to bind the scales to; to maintain
      the structure of an armor piece.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351770
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you think we could use some of these bone-y pieces as a binding?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm... Probably, and since they came from a dragon they'd probably be
      stronger than most metals-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: But, we wouldn't be to shape them ourselves; it's for the best that we
      get a secondary metal to work with.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So... just steel or something?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Aye. That'd work.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351771
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Alright then, apprentice. First, we''re going to sort through the more
      skeletal scales, see what we can work with. '
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351772
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Once we've figured that out, we'll start forging the framing pieces of
      steel- we're trying to work it around the skeletal pieces.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351773
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Finally, we'll begin the process of heating, hammering, and then weaving
      the scales into a mail that will be strung between the frame.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351774
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Understood?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351775
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Heck yeah. Let's get to work.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: I believe that's it-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: And not a moment too soon.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351776
    - rid: 8164893192264351777
    - rid: 8164893192264351831
    - rid: 8164893192264351832
    - rid: 8164893192264351833
    - rid: 8164893192264351834
    - rid: 8164893192264351835
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 456bdc767cc7c384ca7c851c068851f8, type: 2}
    dialog: You've gathered quite the group, Archmage.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 456bdc767cc7c384ca7c851c068851f8, type: 2}
    dialog: Why is that, I wonder?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 456bdc767cc7c384ca7c851c068851f8, type: 2}
    dialog: Is it, perhaps, because you are so incompetent that you do not know what
      happens within your very college?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: With all due respect, I was only recently appointed Archmage after Archmage
      Aren died.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: I assure you, I have a fine handle on this institution-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: I was merely checking eye-witness accounts, to make sure that everything
      we discuss is the full truth.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 456bdc767cc7c384ca7c851c068851f8, type: 2}
    dialog: So who are these people, then?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Faralda, our professor for the school of Destruction-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Tolfdir, our professor for the school of Alteration-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: And Yuri, an apprentice who's been with us for around a week now.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351836
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: All of whom were involved with Ancano before his death.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 456bdc767cc7c384ca7c851c068851f8, type: 2}
    dialog: So, you admit that Ancano died on school grounds?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Indeed, allow me to tell you how his death came to be...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Mirabelle goes through the story that the four of them collectively spun-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Although, she chose to deliberately omit Sayori blasting a mer with the
      Staff of Magnus.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351837
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: That detail would do more harm than good, and Rulindil hasn't made mention
      of Estormo yet.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 456bdc767cc7c384ca7c851c068851f8, type: 2}
    dialog: So, you claim that Ancano went mad with the power he got from this...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 456bdc767cc7c384ca7c851c068851f8, type: 2}
    dialog: '"Eye of Magnus," and had to be put down...?'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: That's a harsh way of putting it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: It's more so that he posed a direct threat to the students and staff
      here-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: As well as the city of Winterhold, and perhaps all of Skyrim and Tamriel
      if left unchecked.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 456bdc767cc7c384ca7c851c068851f8, type: 2}
    dialog: And this "Eye" was conveniently warped away by some Psijic Monk, so that
      there would be no proof?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3b9d3d794309e1848a67c6a6897eddf2, type: 2}
    dialog: It was "conveniently warped away" because it was too dangerous to be
      kept here on school grounds!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 456bdc767cc7c384ca7c851c068851f8, type: 2}
    dialog: And the Staff of Magnus wasn't?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: From what I observed, while it is indeed a powerful staff in the hands
      of a mage-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: The Staff of Magnus' primary purpose is to interact with the Eye of Magnus.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: With the Eye gone, the Staff is just a powerful artifact, not a world-altering
      one.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 456bdc767cc7c384ca7c851c068851f8, type: 2}
    dialog: I see...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 456bdc767cc7c384ca7c851c068851f8, type: 2}
    dialog: I'll be returning to the Embassy, then.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 456bdc767cc7c384ca7c851c068851f8, type: 2}
    dialog: Alinor will decide what is to be done when they receive my report.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Rulindil leaves the Archmage's chambers to return to the Thalmor Embassy
      in Haafingar.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351839
    - rid: 8164893192264351840
    - rid: 8164893192264351841
    - rid: 8164893192264351842
    - rid: 8164893192264351843
    - rid: 8164893192264351844
    - rid: 8164893192264351845
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351846
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3b9d3d794309e1848a67c6a6897eddf2, type: 2}
    dialog: (Mirabelle, could you get a read on him?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: (... Not really, no. I suppose we're lucky he's taking the matter to
      his superiors.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: U-um, can I go now?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351847
    - rid: 8164893192264351848
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351851
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Though if you are leaving college grounds for an extended period of time,
      you really should let me know now.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351852
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, in that case, I do intend to be gone for an extended period of
      time.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351853
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I'd like to meet up with some friends before returning to my Dwemer studies
      in Markarth.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351854
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Very well.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351858
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351855
    - rid: 8164893192264351856
    - rid: 8164893192264351857
    - rid: 8164893192264351859
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (<b>Player</b>? Are you there?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351860
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep. Call me {Player}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351861
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh! A-alright...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351862
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Um, {Player}, do you know where the others are right now?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351863
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki should definitely still be at Jorrvaskr in Whiterun...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351864
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} and Sayori are making their way toward a Forsworn stronghold on
      the path to Markarth...'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: And Monika's in some corner of Falkreath stalking the Dark Brotherhood.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351865
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Why do you ask?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351866
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh, I was planning on seeing if I could make more warp trinkets for
      everyone.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351867
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (While it might be a bit costly to have multiple for everyone; the soul
      gems alone would be quite the price...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351868
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (It's undeniable that they could make travel more convenient and be useful
      for emergency situations.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351869
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (But, if everyone's still somewhat spread out, maybe I should just wait
      around somewhere?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351870
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Do <b>you</b> think there would be a good place for that?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351871
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Whiterun seems to be a pretty central location-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Figuratively and literally...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351872
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Since that's technically where Monika and Natsuki work-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: And right now {mc} and Sayori are on Natsuki's wild ride.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351873
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: So yeah, you should probably be hanging around Whiterun if you want everyone
      to meet up.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351874
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (I see. Thank <b>you</b>.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351875
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (To Whiterun, then.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351876
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri leaves the College and begins her journey to Whiterun.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351877
    - rid: 8164893192264351878
